{"id":28046,"author":"Diabolicx","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cb\u003eTwitter Application\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eMinecraft Username:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eDiabolicx\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eDiscord ID:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eDiabolic#6652\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eIn 1 or 2 sentences, tell me who you are.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eI am a 15 year old guy who has been part of the social media team on Avicus. I left because I felt there was a lack of leadership and mentoring, and I am reapplying because I see that the issue is trying to get fixed. The only experience I've had with marketing was on Avicus, and I am applying because, as you said, Twitter is a good place for beginners that just want to get started.\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhat is your Twitter account?\u003c/b\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://twitter.com/Diabolicx24?s=09\"\u003ehttps://twitter.com/Diabolicx24?s=09\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eHave you ever used Tweetdeck before?\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eYes.\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eHave you ever marketed something using twitter before?\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eThe only experience I have is on Avicus.\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhat changes would you like to see made on the Twitter team?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eAs I mentioned above, I would like to see a change in mentoring, because when I got promoted I felt that the leaders weren't really focusing on getting new members of the team trained properly (even though they were quite capable themselves).\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eHow active are you/how is your work ethic?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eI am currently on a summer break so I'll be quite active, but that activity will go down once school starts (probably reduced to 2-3 hours a week).\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cb\u003eTwitter Application\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eMinecraft Username:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eDiabolicx\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eDiscord ID:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eDiabolic#6652\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eIn 1 or 2 sentences, tell me who you are.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica,